I've been thinking lately, somewhat relatedly, that it might be a nice
gesture if we took a fu'ivla or two from Klingon.  It would enrich our
vocabulary while also connecting us more with a nearby conlang
community.

And maybe we could take some words from Toki Pona and Na'vi too!
Let's take all their words!  One conlang to rule them all, le'avla!

mu'o mi'e la stela selckiku

